    "summary": "Reindeer-skin bag, the flap decorated with a horizontal cross motif in tiny glass beads, threaded and then stitched on at intervals to a mid blue fabric bordered with red and green felted wool (?); the flap backed with mottled brown wool fabric. The bag outlined in blue felted wool (?) on both sides, the handle of plaited reindeer-skin, the fastening ties and attachment loop of twisted reindeer-skin with red and blue felted wool (?) tassels at the ends. The bag lined inside with printed blue cotton with pattern of dots and circles in red, white and blue.",
